WEBVTT

21:31.400 --> 21:36.363
When the Knight of the Flowers unseated him,
I lost this dagger.

21:36.488 --> 21:38.574
To whom?

21:38.699 --> 21:40.576
Tyrion Lannister.

21:40.701 --> 21:42.911
The Imp.

21:43.036 --> 21:45.622
MAN: Grenn, show him
what you farm boys are made of.

21:45.747 --> 21:47.749
(GRUNTING)

21:51.086 --> 21:53.881
If that were a real sword, you'd be dead.

21:54.006 --> 21:59.636
Lord Snow here grew up in a castle
spitting down on the likes of you.
